==Description==
'''Facepalm''' is a sticker that can be purchased in the store for {{Coins|200}}.

==Appearance==
The sticker shows a shocked Default Level 0 [[Commander]] doing a facepalm. It plays the default sticker sound when used.

==Trivia==
*The sound that plays when using the '''Facepalm''' sticker originates from ''Undertale''.

